  "description": "The mid-2000s guitar game in a rehearsal garage, played by the music: chrome gems ride the neck and reach the frets on the beat, bursting into flame, sustains wobble, the score, streak lights, multiplier and rock meter at the sides, section names in scratchy chalk. Under a bare swinging bulb, posters on the boards, the amp stack and a woofer that pumps with the bass."
